{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it. Take it if possible. Process it. Move to new location. Repeat. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />\"",
